		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-26" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;text-align:center;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-11" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">Appendix B</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;"><BR></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Illustrative SPAC Transaction Expenses</FONT></P>
