		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-5" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:48pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(e)<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT></FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-4" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;">Exchange Ratio</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. The definition of Exchange Ratio in Section 1.01 of the Business Combination Agreement is hereby deleted in its entirety and replaced with the following:</FONT></P>
